{
  "info": {
    "name": "Business OS — Real Atlas API (Inventory & Integration Audit)",
    "description": "Complete endpoint collection generated from server/src/routes (93 endpoints across 17 route groups). Auth uses {{accessToken}} populated by the Register/Login pre-requests. No secrets stored. The real-Atlas audit targets a dedicated test database: business_os_api_test.",
